WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.005
Roxy had to get to the Metro City Mint.

2
00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:19.341
The Ghost Bandit was there, and she needed to catch him.

3
00:00:19.342 --> 00:00:23.085
"Hey, everybody," said Roxy to her friends.

4
00:00:23.086 --> 00:00:25.316
"I think I should go home.

5
00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:32.278
I, um, don't feel well."

6
00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:35.791
"Hmm," said Terrell after Roxy left.

7
00:00:35.792 --> 00:00:41.967
"I guess that's why she seemed upset."

8
00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:45.034
Roxy soon arrived at the Metro City Mint.

9
00:00:45.035 --> 00:00:48.640
Police surrounded the entire building.

10
00:00:48.641 --> 00:00:50.762
Detective Smith waved to her.

11
00:00:50.763 --> 00:00:53.752
Roxy flew down.

12
00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:58.300
"Is this a surprise party for the Ghost Bandit?" asked Roxy.

13
00:00:58.301 --> 00:01:00.323
Detective Smith frowned.

14
00:01:00.324 --> 00:01:03.733
"No, it's not a surprise party."

15
00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:06.942
"I'm just kidding," said Roxy.

16
00:01:06.943 --> 00:01:08.898
"So where is he?"

17
00:01:08.899 --> 00:01:12.515
"The Ghost Bandit is still in the mint," said the detective.

18
00:01:12.516 --> 00:01:15.740
"But we don't know where, since he's invisible."

19
00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:20.214
Roxy nodded. "He's not an easy villain to catch.

20
00:01:20.215 --> 00:01:22.505
I almost caught him earlier today.

21
00:01:22.506 --> 00:01:27.316
But he got away.

22
00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:31.123
Everyone thinks I was trying to destroy Metro City."

23
00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.599
"I know," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:38.125
"We need to catch him soon."

25
00:01:38.126 --> 00:01:41.526
"Yes, very soon," said Roxy.

26
00:01:41.527 --> 00:01:45.002
"People are starting to think I'm a villain!"

27
00:01:45.003 --> 00:01:50.504
"I wish we knew how he makes himself invisible," said Detective Smith.

28
00:01:50.505 --> 00:01:53.024
Roxy thought for a moment.

29
00:01:53.025 --> 00:01:55.761
"He must have a special suit.

30
00:01:55.762 --> 00:01:58.399
I don't think he's a real ghost."

31
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.980
"You don't?" asked Detective Smith.

32
00:02:00.981 --> 00:02:02.878
He looked doubtful.

33
00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:04.923
"No," said Roxy.

34
00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:08.754
"A real ghost would be able to move through walls.

35
00:02:08.755 --> 00:02:11.912
But this villain uses doors."

36
00:02:11.913 --> 00:02:15.573
"You're right," said Detective Smith.

37
00:02:15.574 --> 00:02:18.243
Roxy stepped toward the building.

38
00:02:18.244 --> 00:02:21.977
"I'll use my super hearing," she said.

39
00:02:21.978 --> 00:02:25.461
"Maybe I can hear where the Ghost Bandit is."

40
00:02:25.462 --> 00:02:28.727
Roxy closed her eyes and listened carefully.

41
00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:31.385
She heard a fan humming in an office.

42
00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:34.568
She heard a tiny bug flying down a hallway.

43
00:02:34.569 --> 00:02:37.044
And then she heard footsteps.

44
00:02:37.045 --> 00:02:39.324
Roxy's eyes popped open.

45
00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:43.171
"I heard him! He's walking!"

46
00:02:43.172 --> 00:02:48.278
Roxy shot into the mint and followed the sound of the footsteps.

47
00:02:48.279 --> 00:02:52.214
She arrived in a huge room filled with tall stacks of money.

48
00:02:52.215 --> 00:02:55.510
The stacks were in long, neat rows.

49
00:02:55.511 --> 00:02:58.206
It looked like some of the money was missing.

50
00:02:58.207 --> 00:03:02.756
Roxy walked between the rows of money.

51
00:03:02.757 --> 00:03:06.531
"I wonder where the Ghost Bandit is," she thought.

52
00:03:06.532 --> 00:03:08.940
Roxy listened carefully again.

53
00:03:08.941 --> 00:03:12.508
She heard breathing.

54
00:03:12.509 --> 00:03:15.609
"Hey, Ghost Bandit!" Roxy cried.

55
00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.282
"I know you're in here!"

56
00:03:18.283 --> 00:03:23.242
"Boo!" A voice called out and then laughed.

57
00:03:23.243 --> 00:03:26.717
Roxy leaped onto a stack of money.

58
00:03:26.718 --> 00:03:30.733
She looked around but didn't see anyone.

59
00:03:30.734 --> 00:03:35.223
"I'm wearing an invisible suit," said the voice.

60
00:03:35.224 --> 00:03:43.127
"You'll never find me!"
